Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.48,0:00:34.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《洛奇》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.76,0:00:40.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(1975年11月25日 费城)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.31,0:01:28.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油... 打他! 打他!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on... hit him! Hit him!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.90,0:01:54.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你像在跳舞  要给他一点颜色看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're waltzing. Give this sucker some action.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.44,0:01:56.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你打得有气无力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're fighting like a bum.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.01,0:01:58.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要忠告吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want some advice?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.41,0:01:59.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Water.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.65,0:02:01.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有冰冻啤酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cold beer here. Get your beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.65,0:02:02.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.78,0:02:05.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我应该赌三个回合以内玩完吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky, should I bet the fight don't go three rounds?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.15,0:02:08.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你有信心?  - 绝对有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You feel strong?  - Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.99,0:02:10.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要好的忠告吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want some good advice?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.72,0:02:12.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 护齿胶  - 张开嘴...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mouthpiece. - Move into your...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.03,0:02:20.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油  上!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.04,0:03:02.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给他点空间!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give him room!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.15,0:03:15.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,举起手来!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold your hands up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.37,0:03:35.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.78,0:03:39.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接着是一场六回合比赛 本地轻量级拳手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Next, a six-rounder between local lightweights
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.51,0:03:42.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杰博斯对约拿逊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kid Brooks and Sugar Johnson.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.56,0:03:52.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打得好  冠军拳手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good going, champ!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.13,0:03:55.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 嘿  - 嘿  什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey. - Hey, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.86,0:03:58.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 有烟吗?  - 有  这支给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You got a smoke? - Yeah, you could have this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.97,0:04:01.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是废柴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a bum.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.53,0:04:04.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是废柴...知道吗?  你是废物!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a bum... you know that? You're a bum!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.54,0:04:21.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(意大利牡马)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.33,0:04:35.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算你今晚好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really got lucky tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.17,0:04:39.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史派德 这是输了的酬劳40元  扣除15元储物柜和助手费\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spider, here's your share. $40.00, less $15 locker and corner man,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.91,0:04:42.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,5元浴室和毛巾  7%税\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}$5 shower and towel, 7% tax.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.64,0:04:44.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总数是17元2角\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Comes to $17.20
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.71,0:04:46.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史派德  你今晚打得不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You fought a good fight, Spider.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.88,0:04:48.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴尔博亚  胜出者分得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Balboa, you get winner's share.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.68,0:04:51.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,65元  扣除15元储物柜和助手费\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}$65 less $15 locker and corner end,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.32,0:04:54.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,5元浴室和毛巾  加7%税\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}$5 shower and towel and 7% tax,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.65,0:04:57.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总数是40元5角半\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}comes to $40.55
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.99,0:04:59.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我何时再出赛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When do I fight again?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.56,0:05:02.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能两星期后  到时打电话给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe two weeks. Give me a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.40,0:05:04.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,医生20分钟内应该到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The doctor should be in in about 20 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.27,0:05:42.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿  狗仔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.08,0:06:04.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(专业拳击)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.46,0:06:40.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们一年好过一年  知道吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys are gettin' better every year, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.77,0:07:57.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿  你老爹今晚打得不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, your old man did pretty good tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.00,0:08:00.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你干吗没去看?  你应该去看我比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why weren't you there, huh? You should've seen me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.67,0:08:02.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肚子饿吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys hungry? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.11,0:08:06.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.71,0:08:08.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.62,0:08:14.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想看老友莫比·狄克吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanna see your friend Moby Dick, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.72,0:08:21.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莫比·狄克  你好吗?  今天挂念我吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How're you doin', Moby Dick? You missed me today or what? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.36,0:08:25.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这里了  打招呼吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here you go. Say hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.76,0:08:27.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你们懂唱歌跳舞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, if you guys could sing or dance,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.90,0:08:29.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就不用这样  你知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't be doin' this, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.55,0:08:48.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上次买的龟粮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, uh, last turtle food I got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.02,0:08:52.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个...我上次买的龟粮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's, uh... last turtle food I got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.29,0:08:55.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这龟粮里有很多乌蝇...蛾多过乌蝇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It had more flies in it... more moths and flies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.09,0:08:58.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乌蝇多些...蛾多些...谁他妈在乎?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More flies... more moths... who the hell cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.24,0:10:21.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今早好吗?   精神好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How you feelin' this morning, huh? Full of life?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.75,0:10:22.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.58,0:10:27.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好吗  杀手?  这星期的龟粮如何?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, how you doin', killer? How's the turtle food this week?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.15,0:10:28.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.29,0:10:30.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我心情很不好呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me, I'm kind of aggravated, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.02,0:10:32.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢  真抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.26,0:10:35.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是你的错  你不想知原因吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not your fault. I'm just kind of aggravated. Wanna hear about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.33,0:10:37.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之有人不想听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll tell you somebody who don't wanna hear about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.40,0:10:38.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 歌莉亚  你好吗?  - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How you doin', Gloria?  - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.06,0:10:43.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我上次在这里买的龟粮 里面蛾多过乌蝇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The last turtle food I got had more moths in it than flies,you know,Adrian?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.24,0:10:45.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蛾会卡在龟的喉咙里  就在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And these moths get caught in the turtle's throat, right about here,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.97,0:10:48.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它们就会咳嗽  我还得替它们拍龟壳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and they cough, and I gotta smack 'em on the back of the shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.51,0:10:51.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你认为它们会怎样?  会怎样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what do you think they get, huh? And they get what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.95,0:10:55.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.08,0:10:56.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得脑震荡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shell shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.82,0:10:58.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得脑震荡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shell shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.38,0:11:00.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一早就来说差劲的笑话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're startin' with bad jokes early, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.35,0:11:03.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要发明笑话  有时也不容易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, no, it's just inventin' jokes ain't so easy sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.42,0:11:05.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别讲笑话了  行不?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No joke, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.16,0:11:07.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿  我老友今天怎么样?  喂  毕寇斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, how's my buddy doin' today? Yo, Butkus!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.73,0:11:10.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我还没时间去看他  - 喂  毕寇斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I ain't had time to check on him. - Yo, Butkus!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.47,0:11:16.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿  亲我一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, gimme a kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.04,0:11:18.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亲我一下  毕寇斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gimme a kiss, Butkus.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.67,0:11:21.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾莉  你下去清洗一下猫笼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Adrian, I want you to go downstairs and clean all the cat cages.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.41,0:11:22.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很脏呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.09,0:11:40.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些龟粮你要付钱的  傻佬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta pay for that turtle food, rockhead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.13,0:11:43.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是贼...你知道的  歌莉亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, crime don't pay... you know that, Gloria. You know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.72,0:12:10.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 喂  洛奇  你老板好吗?  - 很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yo, Rock, how's your boss?  - Real good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.29,0:12:12.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 洛奇  有再打拳吗?  - 是的  是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, Rock, you fightin' again? - Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.42,0:12:14.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们很快会赚大钱?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, we'll make some money real soon, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.33,0:12:15.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  赚一百万\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, a million dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.76,0:12:19.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  你要去哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you. Where you goin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.67,0:12:27.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你去哪里?  要跑去哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where you goin', huh? Where you runnin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.77,0:12:29.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跑去哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where you runnin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.68,0:12:32.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 喂! 不要打脸!  - 闭嘴!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey! Don't hit the face! - Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.75,0:12:35.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不要打脸!  - 加索先生要那200元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Not the face!  - Mr. Gazzo wants the 200 now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.08,0:12:36.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没钱...向上帝发誓!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm broke... honest to God!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.32,0:12:39.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加索先生说  如果我收不到200元 就打断你手指  明白吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Gazzo says I should get the 200 or break your thumb, you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.55,0:12:42.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 求你!  不要...  - 你叫什么名字?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Please! Please... - What's your name again?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.22,0:12:46.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 鲍伯  - 鲍伯  听着  鲍伯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bob. - Bob. Listen, Bob. Listen, Bob!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.13,0:12:49.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有借有还  明白吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanna dance, you gotta pay the band, understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.03,0:12:52.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要借钱  就自然要还\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanna borrow, you gotta pay the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.36,0:12:55.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会同情你  知道吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, I ain't emotionally involved, Bob, you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.60,0:12:57.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把钱给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me some money.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.17,0:12:59.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把钱给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me some money. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.61,0:13:04.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里只有130元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's 130 here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.51,0:13:06.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就那么多  我没钱了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it. That's it. I'm broke.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.71,0:13:10.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鲍伯  还差70元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Bob. Hey, hey. You're still $70 light.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.45,0:13:13.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不用打断我手指  我的外套拿去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't have to break nothing. Here, take my coat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.52,0:13:16.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,值五六十元的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's worth 50, $60.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.12,0:13:18.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要外套\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here. Take the coat. Take the coat!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.02,0:13:20.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 拿走...  - 你应该未雨绸缪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Just...  - No, you should've planned ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.93,0:13:22.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道吗?  你应该未雨绸缪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know that? You should've planned ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.83,0:13:25.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可以假装 我的手被你打断了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll fake it. I'll tape up the hand like you broke the thumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.43,0:13:26.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该未雨绸缪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should've planned ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.83,0:13:29.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加索不用知道!  加索不会知道一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gazzo don't have to know! He won't be wise to nothin'!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.04,0:13:32.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加索不会知道一切  把外套拿去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gazzo won't be wise to nothin'. Keep the coat!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.31,0:13:34.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿去...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep the...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.24,0:14:07.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加索先生 他只有130元 但我估他下周可还清\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He only had 130, but I think he's good for the rest next week, Mr.Gazzo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.37,0:14:09.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的  洛奇  暂时放过鲍伯吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure, Rocky. Bob's good for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.01,0:14:12.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天就那么多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it for today. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.75,0:14:15.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天去度里奥处收帐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tomorrow collect from Del Rio.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.48,0:14:17.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他迟了三星期  我不喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's late three weeks and I don't like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.28,0:14:19.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天  三星期  度里奥?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tomorrow, three weeks, Del Rio?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.85,0:14:22.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  知道了    度里奥怎样写?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, I got it. Del Rio...how do you spell Del Rio?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.42,0:14:24.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 昨晚表现如何?  - 非常好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How'd you do last night?  - I did real good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.82,0:14:26.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 嘿  - 什么事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey!  - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.73,0:14:28.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你有记车牌吗?  - 什么车牌?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did you get the license number?  - Of what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.96,0:14:30.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那架辗过你脸的货车车牌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The truck that run over your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.00,0:14:33.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放松点  老兄  在这里停车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Relax, Buddy. All right, pull it over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.13,0:14:36.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想下车跟洛奇说几句\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanna let Rocky out, then I'm gonna talk to him for a few seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.16,0:15:01.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你干吗没打断他的手指?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How come you didn't break this guy's thumb like I told you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.63,0:15:03.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你怎知我没有?  - 你以为我不会收到报告?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How do you know I didn't... - You don't think I hear things?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.96,0:15:06.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我今早不是给了你指示吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did I give you a job this morning or I didn't, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.23,0:15:08.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是  - 那你干吗不打断他的手指?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah.  - So, why didn't you break his thumb like I told you to?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.80,0:15:12.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不照我意思做  我很丢脸啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you don't do what I tell you to do, you make me look bad, Rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.47,0:15:15.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想...如果打断了他手指\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I figured...look, I figured if I break the guy's thumb,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.71,0:15:17.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他没工开  就不能赚钱...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he gets laid off, right? Then he can't make...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.71,0:15:19.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些事不用你伤脑筋...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't figure...let me do the figurin', okay, Rock?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.95,0:15:22.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由现在开始  你不要想这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From here on in, just let me do the figurin', you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.51,0:15:25.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些人以为我们搞慈善\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These guys think that we're runnin' some kind of charity or somethin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.18,0:15:26.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以为不会受罚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That they can get off light.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.75,0:15:29.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之从今日起  照我说话做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From here on in, do what I tell you to do
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.22,0:15:31.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然我名誉会受损  你明白吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because it's bad for my reputation, you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.02,0:15:33.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白没...洛奇?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got... You got it, Rock?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.69,0:15:35.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.70,0:15:40.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,度里奥   怎样写?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, how do you spell Del Rio?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.70,0:15:43.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 自己查字典吧!   - 不要这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Open a dictionary, Rock!  - Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.77,0:15:46.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以后我会照你意思  关于手指的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, I won't let that happen no more...about the thumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.67,0:15:49.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.28,0:15:52.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见  肉球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So long, meatbag.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.68,0:15:57.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我应该打断你手指\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should've broke your thumbs!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.61,0:16:29.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇  听说你昨晚打得很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Rock, heard you did real good last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.95,0:16:31.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绝对是  你应该来看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Absolutely. You should've seen me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.52,0:16:33.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不用休息吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you think you oughta take a rest?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.32,0:16:34.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不  我背脊受了伤  - 背脊?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, my back is hurtin'.  - Your back?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.05,0:16:36.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我背脊受了伤  你聋了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My back is hurtin'. You deaf?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.02,0:16:38.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我只是矮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I'm short.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.39,0:17:45.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  迈克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, yo, Mike,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.22,0:17:47.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的锁呢?  我柜里的东西是谁的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where's my lock? Whose stuff is this in my locker?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.79,0:17:51.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是迪柏的东西  这已不是你的储物柜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Dipper's stuff. It ain't your locker no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.43,0:17:55.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么意思?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you talkin' 'bout, it ain't my locker?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.17,0:17:57.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我用了这柜六年  我的衣服呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been my locker for six years. Where's my gear?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.84,0:18:00.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米克叫我装好挂起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mickey told me to bag it and hang it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.08,0:18:06.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你把我的东西放到徙置区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You put my stuff on skid row.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.51,0:18:09.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那储物柜我用了六年了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I been in that locker for six years
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.38,0:18:11.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你居然把我的东西放到徙置区?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you put my stuff in a bag on skid row?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.52,0:18:14.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米克吩咐的  我只是照做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mickey tells me what to do, I gotta do it, right, Rock?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.19,0:18:15.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.65,0:18:17.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在教迪柏练拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's outside working with Dipper.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.39,0:18:20.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他心情不好  - 我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's in a bad mood.  - So am I.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.97,0:18:34.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,双手抬高  双手抬高  留意右面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get your hands up there. Keep your hands up. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.74,0:18:37.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 嘿  米克  - 闭嘴!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, Mick.  - Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.14,0:18:39.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打在身上  对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To the body. To the body. Attaboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.45,0:18:44.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,够点  够点了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time. Time!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.38,0:18:48.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想怎样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The hell. What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.45,0:18:49.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你今天觉得怎样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How're you feelin' today?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.86,0:18:51.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么?  - 你觉得怎样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What?  - I said, how're you feelin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.59,0:18:53.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你是医生?  - 你今天有病?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you...a doctor?  - You got problems today?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.83,0:18:55.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,与你无关...你有什么问题?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never mind my problem...what's your problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.83,0:18:57.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迈克跟我说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My problem is I've been talking to your man Michael.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.90,0:19:00.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干吗拿走我的储物柜?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanna know how come I've been put out of my locker.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.13,0:19:03.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为迪柏需要个柜  迪柏可以争冠军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because Dipper needed it. Dipper's a contender.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.20,0:19:05.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是奋斗型  你呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a climber. You know what you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.10,0:19:06.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么?  - 你是番茄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What?  - You're a tomato.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.54,0:19:07.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 番茄?  - 是的  面对它吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- A tomato?  - Yeah, let's face it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.94,0:19:10.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我这里是做生意的  不是慈善饭堂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I run a business here, not a goddamn soup kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.84,0:19:13.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你昨晚有拳赛吗?  - 有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did you fight last night?  - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.25,0:19:16.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 有无赢?  - 有  第二回合击倒对手胜出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did you win?  - Yeah, I won. Kayo in the second.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.41,0:19:17.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是?  对手是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah? Who'd you fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.68,0:19:19.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史派德·烈高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spider Rico.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.09,0:19:21.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是废柴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a bum.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.89,0:19:24.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得我所有对手都是废柴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think everybody I fight is a bum.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.12,0:19:25.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, ain't they?
