Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.05,0:27:43.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看见了吧  人们不会记得你 只会记得你的名声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see, they don't remember you, they remember the rep.
