Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.50,0:27:55.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你和这些街上的痞子鬼混\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause you're hangin' out with them coconuts in the corner, understand?
