Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.21,0:29:48.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备个屁!  是他们怕了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shape nothin', man! They're afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.61,0:29:50.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们知道全世界会看到这场拳赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They know everybody in the world's gonna see this fight,
