Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.18,0:30:23.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是个充满机会的地方  对吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the land of opportunity, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.68,0:30:26.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以阿波罗·奎迪在元旦当天...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So Apollo Creed, on January 1st,
