Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.81,0:31:29.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 怎么了?  - 我只是要确认一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? What is it?  - I just wanna check this thing out.
