Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.11,0:33:27.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇·巴尔博亚?  没听过这个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky Balboa? Never heard of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.47,0:33:29.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是那名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, it's the name, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.11,0:33:33.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,意大利牡马  传媒一定喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Italian Stallion. The media will eat it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.79,0:33:37.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是谁发现美国?  意大利人  对吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, who discovered America? An Italian, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.34,0:33:40.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么好得过跟他的后人比赛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What would be better than to get it on with one of his descendents?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.75,0:33:42.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是个左撇子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a southpaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.06,0:33:43.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想你浪费时间跟左撇子打\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want you messing around with southpaws.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.86,0:33:46.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他们做什么都反转  - 左撇子没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They do everything backwards.  - Southpaw nothin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.52,0:33:47.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我三个回合可打败他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll drop him in three.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.52,0:33:53.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿波罗·奎迪对意大利牡马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apollo Creed meets the Italian Stallion.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.96,0:33:57.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听上去好像一套怪兽电影\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sounds like a damn monster movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.70,0:33:59.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你拿着球棒干什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, what are you doing with that bat, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.15,0:34:02.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以前打棒球好劲  你妹妹知道我会来?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I used to be deadly at stickball. You sure your sister knows I'm comin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.88,0:34:04.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她很高兴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's very excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.34,0:34:06.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 看我的手肿了  - 是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Look at my swollen hands. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.67,0:34:09.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把肉从冰柜搬进搬出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The joints from walkin' and carryin' meat in and out of freezers.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.91,0:34:11.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弄坏了关节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It plays hell on the joints.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.31,0:34:13.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你应该去看医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you oughta see a doctor. What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.54,0:34:15.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不需要看医生  我需要转工\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't need a doctor. I need a different job.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.07,0:34:17.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,转工  是怎样的火鸡?  大还是小?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Different job. What kind of turkey? Big turkey or small turkey?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.57,0:34:22.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟加索谈谈  说我人品不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Talk to Gazzo about me. Tell him I'm a good man and nothin' bothers me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.04,0:34:26.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我什么都做  我会好好的收帐  打断人骨头没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd make a great collector. Bustin' bones don't bother me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.49,0:34:28.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不想烦你  是大火鸡吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't bother you. A big turkey, right? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.99,0:34:32.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 加索会给我...  - 忘记加索  那份工不好做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Gazzo's gotta come...  - forget Gazzo. It's a bad job, you know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.84,0:34:35.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你有火柴吗?  - 替我找他  当帮我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You got a match?  - Go to him for me. As a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.87,0:34:38.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是  上次我吃火鸡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Yeah. You know, the last time I had a turkey
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.57,0:34:40.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是做两元特价时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was when they were having a $2 special
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.30,0:34:42.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三年前在康哈达自助餐厅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at Horn and Hardog's about three years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.31,0:34:44.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去年  我和龟仔们吃了午餐肉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last year me and the turtles had spam. What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.04,0:34:47.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  听起来是个好主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that sounds like a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.95,0:34:54.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你妹妹真的知道我来?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your sister knows I'm coming for sure, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.85,0:34:57.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道  她很高兴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, yeah. She's very excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.52,0:35:00.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直很孤单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm all alone
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.36,0:35:02.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你忘记加索好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, will you forget about Gazzo, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.43,0:35:06.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我很少求人两次  - 很少求人两次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't ask nobody twice. - I don't ask nobody twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.00,0:35:10.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay away, baby
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.80,0:35:14.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你肯定你妹妹知道我来?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, your sister...you sure your sister knows I'm comin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.47,0:35:16.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是呀  她非常高兴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, yeah, yeah. She's very excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.37,0:35:17.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.71,0:35:22.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保利?  你迟了回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Paulie? You're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.51,0:35:26.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你打去医院了?  我迟十分钟她就会打去医院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Called the hospital? She calls the hospital if I'm ten minutes late.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.88,0:35:29.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How you doin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.96,0:35:32.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一早说了  她很高兴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you she's very excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.83,0:35:38.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么不告诉我他会来?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Paulie, why didn't you tell me you were bringing him here?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.06,0:35:39.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我无心理准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at me. I'm not ready for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.73,0:35:42.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有准备又有什么分别?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would it make a difference if you were?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.10,0:35:44.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会带你出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a friend, and now he's taking you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.17,0:35:45.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我不会去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.17,0:35:48.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要你立即离开厨房\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're in the kitchen, and I want you out right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.71,0:35:58.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你立即出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, I want you outta here instamatically!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.62,0:36:00.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我厌倦了看着你像蜘蛛般孵在屋里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sick of seein' you hanging around like a freakin' spider!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.89,0:36:03.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快出去  享受生命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go out! Live! Enjoy life!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.75,0:36:05.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Paulie, I can't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.32,0:36:07.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不要在我面前扮高贵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't get wise with me, now, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.39,0:36:10.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我受够了你那么无用  - 不要说我无用  保利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm tired of you being a loser. - Don't call me that, Paulie!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.96,0:36:14.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿波罗·奎迪说他会找另一个牺牲者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apollo Creed says he'll be shopping for another victim
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.37,0:36:18.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在200周年纪念冠军赛里 填补格林的空缺...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to fill Green's vacancy for the bicentennial championship fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.14,0:36:19.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你干吗不告诉我他会来?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why didn't you tell me you were bringing him home?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.04,0:36:23.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你怎知我没说?  - 我不能去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How do you know I didn't? - I'm not gonna go, Paulie! I can't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.04,0:36:25.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我不会去!  - 为什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I won't go!  - Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.05,0:36:29.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是感恩节  我焗了火鸡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Paulie, it's Thanksgivin'. I got a turkey in the oven.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.65,0:36:33.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢  焗了火鸡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. A turkey in the oven?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.42,0:36:40.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,焗了火鸡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A turkey in the oven.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.90,0:36:49.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想吃火鸡?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want the bird?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.30,0:36:52.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去后巷吃吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go in the alley and eat the bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.37,0:36:54.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢  保利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Paulie.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.62,0:36:57.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要你出去 离开这间屋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you outta here! Get outta the house!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.82,0:37:00.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出去好好享受生命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go out and enjoy your freakin' life!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.05,0:37:06.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇  你肚饿吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You hungry, Rock?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.32,0:37:16.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保利  今天不如算了吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo, Paulie, listen. Maybe we just better forget all this, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.06,0:37:19.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 算了吧   - 算个屁 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Just forget it. - Forget nothin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.13,0:37:20.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去  跟她说笑话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go ahead. Tell her somethin' funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.70,0:37:23.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么好说的  她心情不好 我又心情不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ain't nothin' to talk about. She's in a bad mood, I'm in a bad mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.62,0:37:26.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以搞笑的 你不是想跟她约会吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know how to do funny. You wanna go out with my sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.90,0:37:29.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是的  - 那就加油啊...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah.  - Well... come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.58,0:37:35.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我不知说什么好  - 要搞笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't know what to say.  - Funny
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.12,0:37:49.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾莉  是我  洛奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo, Adrian, it's me, Rocky.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.69,0:37:51.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇  知吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.55,0:37:53.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.27,0:37:56.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知说什么好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.67,0:37:59.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我未试过跟门说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'cause I ain't never talked to no door before, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.69,0:38:04.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我应该跟道门说什么?  嘿  听着...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, what do I say to a door... hey, listen...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.14,0:38:05.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你做得很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. You're doin' fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.94,0:38:07.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我做得不好  我似个白痴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ain't doin' fine. I look like an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.90,0:38:10.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,继续啦  搞笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep doin' what you're doin'. You're funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.48,0:38:12.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这方面我最在行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know all about these things.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.55,0:38:13.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我像个傻佬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel like a jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.52,0:38:22.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾莉  又是我  洛奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo, Adrian, it's Rocky again, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.55,0:38:28.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知你现在不开心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, uh... I know you ain't too happy at this moment, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.17,0:38:29.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但可否帮我一个忙?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but could you do me a favor?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.83,0:38:32.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没人陪我过感恩节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ain't got nobody to spend Thanksgiving with, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.90,0:38:34.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不如\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.64,0:38:38.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你跟我一起出去吃顿饭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}how 'bout maybe you and I maybe go out together, get something to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.31,0:38:40.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道  或者笑笑  知道吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. Maybe laugh a little bit. Who knows, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.54,0:38:42.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会否想...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you like to, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.42,0:38:47.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会否想跟我出去?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. Would you like to maybe, you know, you and me go out together?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.05,0:38:49.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎样?  好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think? Would you like to?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.09,0:38:56.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会玩得很开心的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna have a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.70,0:38:59.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会玩得很开心的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll have a real good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.93,0:39:05.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你的火鸡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks for the bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.77,0:39:12.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要关掉电视  头痛死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna turn the TV off. I got a headache.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.62,0:39:27.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你妹妹喜欢做什么?  - 溜冰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What does your sister like to do?  - Ice skate.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.13,0:39:29.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾莉  来吧  暖气都走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Adrian, come on. You're lettin' the heat out.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.23,0:39:31.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还不是我付的帐单?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who pays the bills around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.43,0:39:40.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正我不想吃火鸡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, I don't want no turkey anyway, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.27,0:39:43.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但今天是感恩节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it was Thanksgiving.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.08,0:39:46.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么?  - 感恩节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It was what?  - It was Thanksgiving.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.95,0:39:50.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是  对你来说  但对我来说是星期四\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, to you. But to me it's Thursday.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.04,0:40:17.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 很静呢  - 好像关门了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It looks kinda quiet, you know?  - I think it's closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.32,0:40:20.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  大概是我们太早\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I think maybe we're just early or something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.31,0:40:24.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们关门了  - 什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We're closed. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.03,0:40:25.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们休息 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said we're closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.95,0:40:28.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  我去跟他谈妥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Hey, listen, I'm gonna smooth this guy out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.01,0:40:31.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你等等 我很快回来 好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So just wait here for a few minutes. I'll be right back, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.09,0:40:32.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们可以去别处  - 不  没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We could go someplace else.  - No, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.99,0:40:34.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是不开放给公众\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, listen, are you closed to the general public,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.99,0:40:37.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是不开放给所有人...你知道我的意思? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or are you closed to everybody...you know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.99,0:40:41.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已过了6点  今天是感恩节 所以没人来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, it's after 6:00, it's Thanksgiving. That's why there's nobody here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.47,0:40:43.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,况且  你不应该进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And besides, you ain't supposed to be in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.60,0:40:45.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以麻烦你出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So do me a favor and not stay here, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.00,0:40:49.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你可否帮个忙? - 不要这样  我们现在不开门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Would you do me a favor? - Hey, come on. We're not operatin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.56,0:40:52.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这位小姐有病在身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look...this girl here ain't feelin' well, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.81,0:40:55.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,医生说她要多做运动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The doctors say she should go out and exercise once in a while,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.45,0:40:57.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,溜冰是最佳选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and ice skating's probably the best thing, know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.68,0:40:58.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你想怎样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what do you want from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.67,0:41:02.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想你帮忙  你都看见她有病\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to do me a favor. You could see she ain't feelin' too good.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.45,0:41:05.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你让她溜几分钟  我会很感激\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you could let her on the ice, I'd appreciate it. For a few minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.66,0:41:07.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,十分钟  十元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten minutes, ten bucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.56,0:41:09.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,十元?  八元可以吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten bucks? How 'bout eight... eight bucks?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.89,0:41:12.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要讲价  感恩节嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. It's Thanksgiving.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.30,0:41:16.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好吧  九元  一口价  - 十元  整个场任你玩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All right, nine bucks, you got a deal. - You have the ice to yourself. Ten bucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.20,0:41:20.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿溜冰鞋给她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give her the blades.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.26,0:41:22.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不溜冰吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aren't you skating?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.97,0:41:24.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我15岁开始便没溜过冰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nah. I ain't skated since I was 15.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.04,0:41:27.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那时我开始打拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's when I started fightin'...when I was 15.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.44,0:41:29.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,溜冰会令足踝受损\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Skating's kinda bad for the ankles, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.32,0:41:32.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你很会溜冰  是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a pretty good skater, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.72,0:41:37.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正如我刚才说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, like I was saying before on the way over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.04,0:41:40.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以前我把打拳放在首位  但不再是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fightin' used to be tops with me, but no more, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.62,0:41:43.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只想用打拳来证明我不是废柴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All I wanted to do at a fight was prove I was no bum...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.36,0:41:45.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有本事做出色的专业拳手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that I had the stuff to make a good pro, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.80,0:41:47.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一直没有机会?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You never got the chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.20,0:41:51.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没抱怨  我依然打拳  当它是嗜好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, I ain't cryin' about it, 'cause I still fight. I kinda do it like a hobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.10,0:41:53.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,问题是我是 南泽西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I tell you what the trouble is...I'm a southpaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.44,0:41:56.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么是南泽西?  - 即是左撇子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's a southpaw?  - A southpaw means you're left-handed.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.17,0:41:58.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,南泽西较难掌握时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And a southpaw throws your timing off, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.74,0:42:01.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,令对手也掌握不到时间 看上去很笨拙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Other guys it throws their timing off, makes them look awkward.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.14,0:42:02.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没人想让人觉得笨拙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody wants to look awkward.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.95,0:42:05.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你知道南泽西的来由吗?  - 九分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You know where southpaw came from?  - Nine minutes!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.88,0:42:09.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很久以前有个人  大概两百年前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll tell ya. A long time ago, this guy...maybe a couple hundred years ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.29,0:42:12.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在费城打拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he was fightin' in the...I think it was around Philadelphia...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.76,0:42:14.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的手...  他是用左手的 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and his arm... he was left-handed,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.49,0:42:17.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的手向着新泽西  那是南面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and his arm was facing towards New Jersey, you see, and that's south.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.66,0:42:20.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以人们叫他做南泽西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So then that's why they call 'em southpaw, you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.73,0:42:24.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,南泽西  南肯顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Southpaw, South Jersey. South Camden,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.20,0:42:27.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,南泽西  你明白吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}southpaw. You know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.87,0:42:29.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或者这样也好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. Things probably worked out for the best, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.77,0:42:32.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为是左撇子而没机会?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never got a chance, though, because you're left-handed, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.51,0:42:36.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是实情  小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that's absolutely true, you know. Watch out.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.95,0:42:41.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 啊 我的手指脱了臼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just dislocated my finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.32,0:42:45.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 看  慢着  不关你事  看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at that. No, wait. Hey, it ain't your fault. Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.49,0:42:47.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看见吗?  那是旧伤口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See? Look, I had it...it's an old wound, you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.96,0:42:51.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看见吗?  没事的  可以那样弯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look. See? Nothin'. It bends like that, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.96,0:42:53.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我本来是... 按钮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I originally done it... look, push the button.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.93,0:42:57.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞掂  不关你事 我要给你看些东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bong. It works. It ain't your fault. Look, I'm gonna show you somethin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.08,0:42:58.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,七分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seven minutes!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.74,0:43:01.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我本来是...我带着我所有拳赛的照片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I originally done it. I carry pictures of all my fights.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.97,0:43:04.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那本来是 在跟宝贝·坚沙的比赛中弄伤的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I originally done it in the Baby Crenshaw fight. See that?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.84,0:43:07.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宝贝像飞机那样大只 我两只手都在打他脸部时断了骨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Big Baby's about the size of an airplane. I broke both my hands on his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.52,0:43:11.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我输了那场拳赛  但这张相很好 你觉得呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I lost that fight,but that's a nice picture,don't you think?See how it works there?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.35,0:43:12.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Real nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.98,0:43:15.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你玩得开心吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. You having a good time?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.32,0:43:18.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我动作不是很优美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll tell you...you could see I ain't too graceful. I don't move well.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.86,0:43:23.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我动作生硬  但我出拳可以很重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'll tell you, I can really swat, you know what I mean? I can really hit hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.79,0:43:26.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过我是南泽西  没人喜欢跟南泽西打\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'm a southpaw, and nobody wants to fight no southpaw, know what mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.60,0:43:34.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知我是怎样开始打拳的吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know how I got started in fightin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.34,0:43:36.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.41,0:43:39.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是不是太大声?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am I talkin' too loud?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.54,0:43:41.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不  - 三分钟!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No.  - Three minutes!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.21,0:43:45.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爸爸...不是太聪明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father... he's, uh... my old man, he was never too smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.65,0:43:47.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他跟我说  你天生没有脑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He says to me, "You weren't born with much of a brain,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.60,0:43:50.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以要用身体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so you better start using your body," right?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.59,0:43:51.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,于是我做了拳手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I become a fighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.99,0:43:55.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你明我意思吗?  - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You know what I mean? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.09,0:43:56.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你笑什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you... why are you laughin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.10,0:44:01.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我母亲说的刚刚相反\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My mother... she said the opposite thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.23,0:44:03.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她说什么相反?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What'd she say? What'd she say, the opposite?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.97,0:44:06.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她说   你天生身体不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She said you weren't born with much of a body,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.50,0:44:08.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以要用脑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so you better develop your brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.21,0:44:09.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她真的那样说?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did she say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.44,0:44:11.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  够点了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo! Time!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.74,0:44:13.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以问你一个问题吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I ask you a question?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.98,0:44:15.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.48,0:44:19.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你为什么喜欢打拳?  - 因为我不懂唱歌跳舞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why do you wanna fight? - 'Cause I can't sing or dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.82,0:44:23.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要跌倒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eh, oh. Don't fall! Don't fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.35,0:44:26.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好  我做得不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, that was terrific. I'm pretty good at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.92,0:44:28.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喜欢我这样溜冰吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You like the way I skate?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.33,0:44:31.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我上一场比赛的对手 叫史派德·烈高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The last fight I had, I had with this guy named Spider Rico.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.46,0:44:34.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他打到我头破血流 你看见这疤痕吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He busted my head up. You see that scar?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.16,0:44:37.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,擂台上可以很粗暴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll tell ya... things get pretty rough in the ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.74,0:44:49.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人生性怕羞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, with some people, I'm very shy by nature, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.58,0:44:51.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大概是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.51,0:44:57.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得你是生性怕羞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I say you're very shy by nature, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.02,0:45:00.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大概是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.32,0:45:04.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,躲在暗角的流浪汉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ey! Ey. The bum from the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.00,0:45:06.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去找份工作啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get a job, you bum!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.02,0:45:09.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人觉得怕羞是一种病\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, some people think that being shy is a disease,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.99,0:45:12.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我不觉得有问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it don't bother me none.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.47,0:45:13.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不觉得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It don't bother me, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.61,0:45:17.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我为什么要提起?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then why'd I bother bringing it up, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.74,0:45:19.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我蠢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause I'm dumb, that's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.28,0:45:23.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是一对活宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we make a real sharp couple of coconuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.51,0:45:25.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我蠢  你怕羞  你觉得呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm dumb, you're shy. What do you think, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.62,0:45:31.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不明白怎么会有人想做拳手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't understand why anybody would wanna be a fighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.46,0:45:34.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一定要是白痴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you gotta be a moron.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.69,0:45:38.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才会做拳手  你知道我的意思?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta be a moron to wanna be a fighter, you know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.36,0:45:41.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那骗人的行业注定你最终要成为废柴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a racket where you're almost guaranteed to end up a bum.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.83,0:45:45.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我不觉得你是废柴  - 我至少是半条废柴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't think you're a bum. - Well, I'm at least half a bum, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.54,0:45:47.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'll tell ya somethin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.54,0:45:50.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打拳最难受的  是之后那早上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The worst thing about fightin' is the mornin' after, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.84,0:45:52.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 知吗?  - 之后那早上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The mornin' after? - I'll tell you. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.28,0:45:56.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  拳赛之后那早上  你就像个大伤口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The mornin' after a fight, you're nothing but a large wound, know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.88,0:45:59.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有时全身痛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes I got pains all over me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.32,0:46:03.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从床去厕所都想叫的士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel like callin' a taxi to take me from the bed into the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.12,0:46:04.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,头发痛  眼睛痛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your hair hurts, your eyes hurt,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.96,0:46:07.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,面部损伤  双手肿胀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your face is all busted up, your hands are swollen, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.73,0:46:11.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看我块面  64场拳赛  看那鼻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at this face. 64 fights. Look at that nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.16,0:46:12.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看见我鼻子吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See that nose?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.56,0:46:15.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鼻子被人打过  却未断过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That nose ain't never been broken. 64 fights.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.03,0:46:17.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被人咬过  扭过  撞过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've had guys bustin' on it, I had guys chewin' on it,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.93,0:46:21.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之劈过搥过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}twistin' it, punchin' it... I mean, whack! Boom!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.17,0:46:23.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们成日打我鼻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These guys, they hittin' my nose all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.91,0:46:27.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但从没打断过  我为此很自豪  很罕见的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never broken. I'm very proud of that. Isn't that rare? That's rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.68,0:46:30.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 既然会受伤  为什么还要打?  - 你认为呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why do you do it if it hurts? - Why do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.18,0:46:35.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你不懂唱歌跳舞?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause... you can't sing and dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.09,0:46:37.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了  大概是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, somethin' like that. Somethin' like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.65,0:46:39.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要进来吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you wanna come inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.03,0:46:43.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我要走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.43,0:46:45.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧  我有小动物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, come on. Hey, I got some animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.50,0:46:49.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我里面有很珍贵的动物  进来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got these rare... very rare animals inside. Come on. Come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.30,0:46:51.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我要走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no. I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.23,0:46:54.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也要走了  是去厕所  来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I gotta go, too. I gotta go to the bathroom. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.47,0:46:55.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.81,0:46:58.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我真的要走 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.20,0:47:01.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的脸  很可靠吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey,look at this face.Is that a face you could trust or what?Is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.32,0:47:05.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我这样子应该印在邮票上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They oughta stick this face on a stamp. What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.32,0:47:08.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.52,0:47:15.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  进来啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.51,0:47:36.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开灯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Click.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.45,0:47:44.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾莉  你饿吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo, Adrian, are you hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.25,0:47:45.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.72,0:47:50.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有食物  你要汽水  面包圈或什么吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got some things in there. If you like soda, some donuts or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.69,0:47:54.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也有蛋糕  不要?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A couple cupcakes. Huh? No?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.43,0:47:56.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有朱古力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I got some chocolate in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.57,0:47:57.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.61,0:48:06.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里很热\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hot in here, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.58,0:48:11.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想听音乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could go for some music.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.39,0:48:18.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾莉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo, Adrian.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.86,0:48:22.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些就是我说的奇异动物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are the exotic animals I was tellin' you about.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.09,0:48:24.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们是我的朋友  格夫和林肯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are my friends Cuff and Link.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.19,0:48:25.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我卖给你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I sold 'em to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.53,0:48:27.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知是你卖给我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure, I know you sold them to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.26,0:48:29.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你记得吗?  你在那间宠物店工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember you were workin' at that pet shop, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.99,0:48:32.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你第一天上班  我进来买了这些动物 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First day you was there, I came in and bought both these animals, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.07,0:48:34.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我记得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.40,0:48:36.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我买了这个缸和里面的动物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I came and I bought this bowl and I bought the, uh, bought the animals themselves,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.21,0:48:40.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一些食粮  和放缸底的石粒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}some food, the marbles that go in the bottom there.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.01,0:48:42.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记得那座山吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember? Remember that mountain?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.91,0:48:44.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要丢了那座山 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had to get rid of that mountain,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.61,0:48:46.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为总是反转倒下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}though, 'cause they kept falling over and flipping.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.52,0:48:53.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么不过来坐?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo, why don't you come on over here and sit down?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.66,0:48:58.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,张梳化很好坐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a nice couch. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.26,0:49:03.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那边有大虫  这边较安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's big bugs in there, you know. It's safer over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.47,0:49:07.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要坐下吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanna sit down?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.44,0:49:17.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是你父母?  - 对  是我父母\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Uh, these...these your parents? - Yeah, that's...that's both of them there.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.05,0:49:19.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个是你?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this you?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.35,0:49:21.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是  我那时八岁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that's me when I was eight years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.12,0:49:23.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是婴儿版的意大利牡马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the Italian Stallion when he was a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.36,0:49:29.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过来吧  舒服点  放松\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you come on over and make yourself comfortable? Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.86,0:49:36.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有电话吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have a phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.43,0:49:37.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有  我拔了电话线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I ain't got no phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.83,0:49:39.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为经常有人打来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had it pulled 'cause of people calling all the time, and, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.87,0:49:44.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,令我很烦  骚扰我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who needs the aggravation, right? The interruptions.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.94,0:49:46.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想打给谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who'd you wanna call?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.21,0:49:48.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想让我哥哥知道我在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanna let my brother know where I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.08,0:49:51.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.02,0:49:54.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他可能会担心我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think he might be worried.
