Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.00,0:56:56.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.67,0:56:59.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿波罗·奎迪也相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apollo Creed does.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.08,0:57:01.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会证明给全世界看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he's gonna prove it to the whole world
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.08,0:57:03.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是让一个无名之辈 有争冠军的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by giving an unknown a shot at the title.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.05,0:57:07.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而那无名之辈就是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that unknown is you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.08,0:57:08.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他选了你  洛奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He picked you, Rocky.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.09,0:57:12.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是毕生难逢的机遇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky, it's the chance of a lifetime.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.42,0:57:15.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能错过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't pass it by.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.86,0:57:18.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你意下如何?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.33,0:57:25.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  不要拍照了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, fellas, fellas. That's enough pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.47,0:57:27.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们想问阿波罗几个问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We wanna ask Apollo a few questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.30,0:57:29.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿波罗  你对费城感觉如何?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apollo, how do you like the city of brotherly love?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.04,0:57:33.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,身在费城令我充满爱国情绪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, just being in Philadelphia makes me feel patriotic.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.44,0:57:34.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美丽城市里的美丽人民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beautiful people in a beautiful city
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.01,0:57:37.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在街上走来  祝福我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}comin' up to me on the street wishing me the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.35,0:57:40.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爱我费城的兄弟  而我因身为美国人而骄傲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love my Philadelphia brothers, and I'm proud to be an American.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.06,0:57:43.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿波罗?  拳王?  你为什么同意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Champ, Apollo, why did you agree to fight a man
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.70,0:57:45.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟一个毫无胜出机会的人决斗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who has virtually no chance of winning?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.06,0:57:48.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,历史已证实了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, if history proves one thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.12,0:57:51.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美国历史证实了任何人都有机会赢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}American history proves that everybody's got a chance to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.79,0:57:54.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们没听过霍谷或賓架山吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Didn't you guys ever hear of Valley Forge or Bunker Hill?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.80,0:57:56.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 阿波罗?  - 恩?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Apollo, Apollo, Apollo.  - Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.87,0:57:59.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在本国史上最重要的节庆日 跟一个白人决战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is a coincidence that you're fighting a white man
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.27,0:58:01.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是纯粹巧合吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on the most celebrated day in the country's history?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.50,0:58:02.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.84,0:58:05.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在本国史上最重要的节庆日 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it a coincidence that he's fighting
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.14,0:58:07.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟一个黑人决战又是巧合吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a black man on the most celebrated day in the country's history?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.34,0:58:08.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说得好  阿波罗!  说真相  兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right on! Tell the truth, brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.01,0:58:11.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿波罗  你觉得你的挑战者如何?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, Apollo, tell me... how do you feel about your challenger?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.81,0:58:13.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我觉得他如何?  - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How do I feel about him?  - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.38,0:58:15.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你什么意思?  过来  洛奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean? Come here, Rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.22,0:58:16.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的对手  洛奇  你是意大利人吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My main man, Rocky, ain't you Italian?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.40,0:58:19.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是  我是意大利人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I'm Italian.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.29,0:58:21.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你问了干吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, now, what does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.19,0:58:24.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算他不打得  都赌得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It means if he can't fight, I bet he can cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.49,0:58:25.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, Rocky.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.73,0:58:28.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮个忙  打穿他个肺...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do me a favor. His lungs... punch 'em out.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.46,0:58:29.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Paulie.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.93,0:58:33.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你打算怎样打阿波罗·奎迪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, Rocky, how do you expect to fight Apollo Creed?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.27,0:58:35.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢  奎迪是最出色的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, well, geez, you know. Creed's the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.57,0:58:37.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只有尽力而为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess I'll have to do the best I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.91,0:58:40.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉我  洛奇  就我们两个...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me, Rocky, just between us...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.38,0:58:43.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你那意大利牡马的称号 是怎样来的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where did you get the name "Italian Stallion"?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.51,0:58:46.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我八年前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh... uh, I invented that about eight years ago
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.92,0:58:53.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃晚餐时想到的  洛奇  你对于会得到十五万元报酬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when I was eatin' dinner. Rocky, now your payday will be $150.000.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.19,0:58:54.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么意见?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any comment?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.13,0:58:59.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没有意见  对吗  洛奇?   没有意见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You... you got no comment, Rocky, right? No comment.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.20,0:59:00.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢  洛奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right. Thank you, Rocky.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.60,0:59:03.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢着  我想跟我女朋友打招呼  可以吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute. I just wanna say hi to my girlfriend, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.40,0:59:06.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我...  - 艾莉  是我  洛奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I, uh... - Yo, Adrian! It's me, Rocky.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.94,0:59:09.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你相信吗?  很多麦克风和记者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at this. Can you believe all this? They put a microphone on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.01,0:59:11.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你不是吧  - 谢谢  洛奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You didn't.  - Thank you, Rocky.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.23,0:59:16.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你推什么?  - 谢谢  洛奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Quit pushin', man!  - Thank you, Rocky.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.25,0:59:19.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他令你变傻仔  你不介意?  是我就打爆他的嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't it matter he's makin' you out a fool? I'd break his lips.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.92,0:59:23.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他在出暗拳  - 我不介意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's taking cheap shots.  - It don't bother me none.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.62,0:59:28.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇  你要找人帮你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo, Rock...I guess you'll be looking for people to help you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.82,0:59:33.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 帮什么?  - 帮你过正常生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Help in what?  - Keep you livin' the clean life.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.26,0:59:35.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我生活得很好  你知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll do okay. You know.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.57,0:59:37.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你需要人帮你练习\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need someone to help with the exercise,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.37,0:59:41.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,递毛巾  做跑腿?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and someone standing by with a towel, or runnin' errands. You know.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.54,0:59:44.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之前有谁关心我?  没有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, yo, Paulie, who cared about me yesterday, huh? Nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.34,0:59:46.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我会自己锻炼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I just think I'm gonna train myself, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.04,0:59:49.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有那些专业人员帮你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Without such good people around to help,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.18,0:59:51.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你机会很小\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you don't have such a good chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.28,0:59:54.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爱恩斯坦被逐出校两次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Einstein flunked out of school twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.68,0:59:56.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That so?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.29,0:59:57.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.42,1:00:00.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,贝多芬是聋的  海伦·凯勒是盲的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beethoven was deaf. Helen Keller was blind.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.49,1:00:02.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得洛奇机会不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think Rocky's got a good chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.73,1:00:10.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保利  要我帮你拿啤酒吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Want me to get you a beer, Paulie?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.47,1:00:14.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想帮我?  离开我的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you lookin' to do a good deed? Keep out of my freakin' life!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.77,1:00:17.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我做错了什么?  - 没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What'd I do?  - Nothin'.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.51,1:00:21.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我说错了话吗?  - 你没说什么  不要紧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? Did I say something wrong?  - You didn't say nothin'. It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.18,1:00:24.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了...  你没说什么 什么都没说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right... you didn't say nothin'! Nothin' at all!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.65,1:00:28.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我走先  - 哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I gotta go.  - Oh.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.45,1:00:31.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,椒盐脆饼在哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's the freakin' pretzels?!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.82,1:00:38.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想吃椒盐脆饼  喂  我们没啤酒?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got the pretzels! Hey! We ain't got any beer?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.83,1:00:41.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以为你会去买啤酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you were supposed to pick up some beer.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.67,1:00:53.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚在电视上听到自己名字 觉得怎样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How'd you like hearing your name on TV tonight?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.28,1:00:58.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很震惊  你干吗那样做?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was shocked. Why'd you do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.18,1:01:00.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你跟我开玩笑  是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. You're puttin' me on, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.08,1:01:01.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.98,1:01:03.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你什么时候来?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What time should I expect you?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.72,1:01:07.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大约7点  好的   嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, about 7:00. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.52,1:01:28.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你记得我之前说 电视上发生的事我不介意吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know how I said that stuff on TV didn't bother me none?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.26,1:01:29.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.79,1:01:33.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实我介意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It did.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.04,1:01:47.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我带你来  是因为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, the reason I brought you here is because, uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.61,1:01:49.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想知道你有训练用的资金吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanna know if you got any money for training expenses, eh?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.82,1:01:51.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有几元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got a few dollars.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.05,1:01:53.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,几元?  这里  放进拳套里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A few bucks? Well, here. Put this in your glove.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.99,1:01:57.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是什么?  - 500元  不用担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's this?  - 500 bucks. Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.75,1:02:00.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你从来没有运气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, you ain't never had any luck,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.65,1:02:02.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但这次你可能有女人运  你觉得呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I think this time Lady Luck may be in your corner. What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.87,1:02:06.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe. Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.33,1:02:08.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你的钱  汤尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, thanks for the money, Tony, you know.
