Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.62,1:07:34.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你需要帮忙...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, if you wanted help...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.69,1:07:37.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你需要帮忙  干吗不问我?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I say, if you wanted help, why didn't you ask?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.09,1:07:38.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你干吗不那样问我  孩子?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why didn't you just ask me, kid?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.99,1:07:41.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我问过你  但你没听见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I asked, but you never heard nothin'!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.60,1:07:43.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.53,1:07:47.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.20,1:07:50.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知我...我76岁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know I...I'm 76 years old.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.11,1:07:58.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, uh... well.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.92,1:08:08.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他妈的在哪里...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where the hell is...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.41,1:08:33.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么久才来这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Took you long enough to get here.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.02,1:08:37.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过了十年才来我家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Took you ten years to come to my house?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.25,1:08:39.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不喜欢我的家吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Huh, what's the matter? You don't like my house?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.59,1:08:41.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的家发臭?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does my house stink?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.66,1:08:44.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了  是很臭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right... it stinks!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.46,1:08:47.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没受过你恩惠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't have no favors from you!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.53,1:08:49.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要这样没礼貌对我!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't slum around me!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.00,1:08:52.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还在说全盛时期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Talkin' about your prime.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.47,1:08:54.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我的全盛时期呢  米克?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about my prime, Mick?!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.53,1:08:56.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至少你有过全盛时期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least you had a prime!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.47,1:08:59.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没有全盛时期  我什么都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't have no prime. I didn't have nothin'!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.61,1:09:02.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,双腿不行了  一切都不行了 没人给过我什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leg's are goin', everything is goin', Nobody's gettin' no nothin'.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.68,1:09:04.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人来叫我打场拳赛  有什么大不了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guy comes up, offers me a fight. Big deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.91,1:09:07.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想打那场拳赛吗?  好  我去打那场大赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wanna fight the fight? Yeah, I'll fight the big fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.68,1:09:11.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会去打那场大赛  而且会赢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't wanna fight. Know what's gonna happen to me? I'm gonna get that!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.52,1:09:12.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会赢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna get that!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.55,1:09:16.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要到擂台边看吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you wanna be ringside to see it?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.40,1:09:18.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要吗?  想帮我?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do ya? You wanna help me out?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.96,1:09:21.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想看我被人打扁脸吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Huh? Do you wanna see me get my face kicked in?!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.70,1:09:23.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,双腿不行  什么都不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Legs ain't workin', nothing's workin',
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.60,1:09:26.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以为我会去跟拳王决斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but they go. "Go on, fight the champ."
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.63,1:09:27.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是  我会跟他打\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I'll fight him.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.90,1:09:32.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被人打扁脸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get my face kicked in.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.57,1:09:36.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还走来这里  想搬进来吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you come around here. You wanna move in here with me?!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.24,1:09:38.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来呀  这间屋很不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on in! It's a nice house!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.05,1:09:42.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很不错 进来呀 臭的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Real nice. Come on in and move. It stinks!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.12,1:09:44.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,整间屋发臭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This whole place stinks.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.75,1:09:47.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想帮我?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanna help me out? Well, help me out!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.64,1:09:51.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来  帮我呀  我在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, help me out. I'm standin' here!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.42,1:10:54.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,气温只有零下2度  我们看天气预测\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's only about 28 degrees. We'll check that forecast in just a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.65,1:10:57.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得是恶作剧  很奇怪...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel very mischievous. Very weird. Very...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.76,1:11:01.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我车上的是胶椅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, the thing is, I got vinyl seats in my car.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.23,1:11:04.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我今早坐上架车  大叫"呜"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I hit the seats this morning, I just went. "Whew!"
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.36,1:11:06.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我都起了床\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm thinkin', if I'm up,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.50,1:11:09.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,德拉威谷的人都应该起了床  你同意吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}everybody in the Delaware Valley should be up. Do you agree with me?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.74,1:11:13.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早上4点零3分  你还会做什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, at three minutes past 4:00, what else are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.10,1:11:16.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 喂?  - 早晨  桂玛太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hello?  - Good morning, Mrs. Kramer.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.37,1:11:20.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是费城电台的东·卡能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Don Cannon, W-I-B-G Philadelphia.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.28,1:11:21.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你今早好吗?  - 什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How are you this morning? - Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.85,1:11:23.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 桂玛太太?  - 什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mrs. Kramer?  - What?!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.25,1:11:27.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你居然够胆那么早打来!  再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you have a lot of nerve calling me at this hour in the morning! Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.76,1:11:35.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,W-I-B-G\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}W-I-B-G.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.23,1:11:40.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,费城\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Philadelphia
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.77,1:11:43.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和桂玛太太都起了床 这是很好的早上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me and Mrs. Kramer are up, and it's a good morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.70,1:11:46.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,零下2度  我需要人来拥抱  外面很冷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I tell ya, I need someone to snuggle with, 28 degrees. It's cold out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.24,1:11:50.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是报应  我们上两星期逃脱了谋杀罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We deserve it. We've been getting away with murder the last couple weeks.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.01,1:11:53.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今日最高气温是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our high today could possibly be 58, and that's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.48,1:11:55.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚我们会回到零下温度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tonight we're back down on the 20 degree range,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.05,1:11:57.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,近郊再冷一点  明天幸运的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a little colder in the suburbs, and tomorrow, with a little bit of luck,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.62,1:12:01.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可上到4度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we may hit 40 somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.19,1:12:03.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但现在是零下2度  很冷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's 28, it's awfully chilly.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.09,1:12:06.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出门前记得保暖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make sure you have it snuggled on before you bring it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.66,1:14:27.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(费城肉品包装协会成员)
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.03,1:14:29.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有没有搞错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.20,1:14:32.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里很臭  你知吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stinks in... hey, come on. It stinks in here, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.77,1:14:34.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是  我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah... I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.58,1:14:38.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全部都是你屠宰的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, did you kill all these things?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.41,1:14:41.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  是在对面街屠宰的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Across the street.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.08,1:14:45.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里像动物殓房\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This place is like an animal morgue, you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.65,1:14:49.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 太冷了  - 是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's a little cold in here, ain't it?  - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.23,1:14:55.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁屠宰的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who killed all these things?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.70,1:14:58.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你疯了吗  保利?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, are you crazy, Paulie?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.26,1:15:00.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不付钱给加索  就要上吊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you don't pay Gazzo, you end up on the hook.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.60,1:15:02.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加索是好人  你知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Gazzo's a good man. You know that.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.00,1:15:04.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要激动  我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, don't get excited. I know that.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.90,1:15:08.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我才要你跟他谈 请我做收帐的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why I want you to talk to him about me...the collectin' job.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.81,1:15:11.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带我离开这臭冰柜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get me out of this stinkin' freezer.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.28,1:15:12.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不如你当帮自己  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you do yourself a favor?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.01,1:15:15.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,继续做这份工 那样吃得较好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you keep this job, because you eat better, you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.69,1:15:20.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里会下雪的吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does it ever snow in here?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.45,1:15:24.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你跟我妹妹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh... you and my sister.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.19,1:15:26.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进展如何?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How you gettin' along together?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.69,1:15:27.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你认为呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.73,1:15:31.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不肯定  洛奇  实情是怎样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I'm not sure, Rock. What's the story?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.07,1:15:34.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关于什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About what?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.07,1:15:36.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们之间所发生的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the story? What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.54,1:15:38.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真的喜欢她?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you really like her?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.34,1:15:39.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我当然喜欢她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure, I like her.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.04,1:15:44.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不明白  她有什么吸引你?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't see it. What's the attraction?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.68,1:15:49.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道  大概是互补不足\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. It fills gaps, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.25,1:15:53.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么不足 ?  - 我不知道  我和她都有不足之处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's gaps?  - I don't know. Gaps. She's got gaps, I got gaps.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.79,1:15:55.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一起便能互补不足\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Together, we fill gaps. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.62,1:15:59.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你跟她上过床吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ballin' her?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.46,1:16:03.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能用诬秽的话来说你妹妹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you don't talk dirty about your sister.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.80,1:16:07.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有跟她上床吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you screwin' my sister?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.54,1:16:14.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你明白吗?  我为什么不介绍你给加索\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see? That's why I can't connect you with Gazzo, you know that, Paulie?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.21,1:16:17.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你是大嘴巴  你太多话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because you got a big mouth, you know. You just talk too much.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.91,1:16:20.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里很冷  我要回家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gettin' cold in here. I'm going home.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.15,1:16:23.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里冷?  这里是很冷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cold in here?! It is cold in here!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.12,1:16:25.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里很臭  你很臭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It stinks in here, and you stink!
