Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.94,1:23:27.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们来到这个...  - 那冻肉佬伸了头进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The reason we're standing... - The meat guy's stickin' his face in.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.41,1:23:30.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们再来过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's try it again, Rocky.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.64,1:23:34.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天我们来到访问  重量级挑战者洛奇·巴尔博亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Today we're here with heavyweight challenger Rocky Balboa.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.55,1:23:36.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们来到这个冷藏库\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The reason we're standing in this refrigerated box
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.02,1:23:40.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是因为巴尔博亚先生有一套特别的训练方法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is that Mr. Balboa has an unusual method of training.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.35,1:23:42.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过一会他会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In a moment, he's going to demonstrate that
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.26,1:23:43.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,向大家示范\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for the viewing audience at home.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.99,1:23:47.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但首先要问洛奇 你怎么会来到冷藏库训练的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But first, Rocky, how did you come to train in an icebox?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.06,1:23:50.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我的朋友...那边那个人...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, well, my friend... the guy over there...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.53,1:23:53.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有天他让我进来 我打了这里的牛肉  发觉很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}let me in one day and I hit the beef here and kinda liked it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.67,1:23:57.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我是挑战者 这里的老板也不介意我来训练\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And since I become a challenger, the owner don't mind that I come in.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.40,1:24:01.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这训练方法普遍吗?  其他拳手会打生肉吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this a common training method? Do other fighters pound raw meat?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.54,1:24:03.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  是我发明的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I think I invented it.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.44,1:24:05.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,订好擂台边的座位  给我的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't forget to confirm the reservation for my people at ringside,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.96,1:24:09.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和让我的发型师飞来费城\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and be sure to fly my barber to Philly.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.19,1:24:16.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给了西岸闭路广告多少钱?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much is being channeled into West Coast closed circuit advertising?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.09,1:24:18.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 三十万   - 加到四十五万\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- $300,000.  - Make it 450.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.56,1:24:20.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以我名义送二百支玫瑰给市长夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And send the mayor's wife 200 roses from me,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.79,1:24:23.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记着要拍照片给报馆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and make sure we get a picture of it for all the newspapers.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.93,1:24:26.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要中西部那十五个电台的广告时段吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you wanna run the 15 radio spots in the Midwest?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.83,1:24:29.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些钱放在加拿大做宣传更好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you could spend your money better in Canadian publicity.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.84,1:24:32.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了...阿波罗 我在多伦多有些朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By the way...I've got a couple of friends up in Toronto
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.24,1:24:34.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以给你税务优惠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who'd probably be able to get you a good tax break.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.41,1:24:37.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佐治  我喜欢你的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}George, I like your friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.55,1:24:46.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拳王  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Champ...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.19,1:24:48.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快过来看  你的对手上电视了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you oughta come look at this boy you're gonna fight on TV.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.69,1:24:51.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来他很认真\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like he means business.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.09,1:24:52.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也很认真\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I mean business, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.82,1:24:55.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪莉  出面还有咖啡吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shirley, we got any more coffee out there?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.23,1:24:57.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然有  奎迪先生  我立即去拿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, certainly, Mr. Creed. I'll get you some right away.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.70,1:25:00.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拳赛之后  或者我会退休 竞选做皇帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After the fight, I may just retire and run for emperor.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.97,1:25:02.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个地域唯一的节目\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The arena's the only program concession,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.97,1:25:06.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将要包括400...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the gross rental of the arena is gonna include the 400 ushers, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.51,1:25:20.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戴安娜·路易丝在冻肉场 跟南泽西洛奇·巴尔博亚的访问完毕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Diana Lewis, in the meat house with southpaw Rocky Balboa.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.87,1:26:08.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他找了记者来?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he called the reporters?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.00,1:26:11.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是  打乱了我的训练时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, it threw my whole training schedule off.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.67,1:26:13.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要恼他  他只是想帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't be mad at him. He's just trying to help.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.04,1:26:15.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没恼他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Adrian, I ain't mad, it's just that, uh,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.65,1:26:19.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是有记者令我乱了阵脚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when a reporter's around, I get out of joint
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.35,1:26:22.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为他们会把我拍得很差  保利知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'cause they take cheap shots, and Paulie knows that.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.68,1:26:25.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保利不停叫我介绍工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Paulie keeps askin' me for a job all the time,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.65,1:26:28.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他对打架一窍不通\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but he don't know nothin' about fightin'.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.75,1:26:30.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会跟他说吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you gonna say anything to him?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.92,1:26:35.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说什么?  我不知道他想从我身上得到什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's to say? I just don't know what he wants from me.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.66,1:26:39.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不要从你身上得到什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want nothin' from you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.67,1:26:42.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不要从你身上得到什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want nothin' from you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.74,1:26:46.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是施舍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This ain't no charity case.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.34,1:26:47.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滚出我间屋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get outta my house.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.91,1:26:49.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这间屋不是你一个人的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not just your house.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.58,1:26:52.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不再是我朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ain't no friend no more.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.08,1:26:56.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 滚出我间屋  我刚说了 - 不要那样对他说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get out of my house, I just says. - Don't talk to him like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.38,1:26:58.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你两个都滚出我间屋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Both of you get out of my house.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.55,1:27:02.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外面很冷  保利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's cold outside, Paulie.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.57,1:27:14.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不准你再搞她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want you messin' her,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.80,1:27:17.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我养大你不是要你跟这人渣一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I don't raise you to go with this scum bum!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.60,1:27:19.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来啊  你想打我吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Wanna hit on me? Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.44,1:27:22.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来 我会打断你双臂 等你不能再打拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll break both your arms so they don't work for ya!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.36,1:27:28.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停手   我不够资格去见加索?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right! I'm not good enough to meet with Gazzo...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.71,1:27:29.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加索算什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what I think of Gazzo!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.95,1:27:32.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在你做了大人物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you're a big-shot fighter on your way up,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.42,1:27:34.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不帮朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you don't even throw a crumb to your friend Paulie!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.65,1:27:36.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,枉我每朝拿冻肉给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I go and get you meat every morning!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.99,1:27:39.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你忘了?  我还把妹妹给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You forgot that! Then I even give you my sister, too!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.73,1:27:42.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你没有人性才会说这样的话  - 我没有人性?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Only a pig would say that! - I'm a pig?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.96,1:27:44.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没有人性会把最好的给你?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A pig gives you the best?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.70,1:27:48.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这个没有用的人  我没结婚也是因为你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're such a loser! I don't get married because of you!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.57,1:27:51.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能自己住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't live by yourself!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.87,1:27:55.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我撮合你两个  你不要忘记\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I put you two together! And you... don't you forget it!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.44,1:27:56.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你欠我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You owe me!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.55,1:28:01.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你欠我  - 我欠你什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You owe me!  - What do I owe you?!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.78,1:28:04.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你应该要好好对我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're supposed to be good to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.35,1:28:07.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我欠你什么  保利?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do I owe you, Paulie?! What do I owe ya?!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.75,1:28:09.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我对你很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I treat you good!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.49,1:28:12.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我为你煮饭  清洁  洗衣服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cook for you, I clean for you, I pick up your dirty clothes!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.99,1:28:16.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直照顾你  我没欠你什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I take care of you, Paulie! I don't owe you nothin'!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.06,1:28:19.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你令我觉得自己没有用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you made me feel like a loser!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.63,1:28:22.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是没有用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not a loser!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.54,1:28:24.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你失了贞操  - 什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're busted!  - What?!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.23,1:28:26.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是处女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not a virgin!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.84,1:28:30.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你让一个男人脱掉你裤子  她失了贞操\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You let him into your pants! She's busted!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.81,1:28:35.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想再搬冻肉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't haul meat no more!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.25,1:29:07.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想我搬到你那吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want a roommate?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.79,1:29:14.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.16,1:29:18.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当你走上擂台\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, now, when you walk into the ring
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.66,1:29:21.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,面对世界第一的重量级拳手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with the number one heavyweight of the world,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.23,1:29:22.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会准备好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you'll be ready, won't ya?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.90,1:29:28.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么?  因为我等了50年  去令你准备好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why? Because I waited for 50 years to make you ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.13,1:29:33.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你将会超级强劲   像他们说的  你可以吃闪电\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll be able to spit nails, kid. Like the guy says, you're gonna eat lightning
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.27,1:29:35.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放雷屁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you're gonna crap thunder.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.27,1:29:38.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你将变成危险人物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna become a very dangerous person.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.34,1:29:39.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 喂  - 米克  你好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yo, Mickey.  - Hey! How are ya?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.45,1:29:44.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇  我向你介绍这里的洗伤人 艾尔·西凡尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Rock. I want you to meet our cutman here, Al Salvani.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.05,1:29:47.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 看看他的眼睛 - 艾尔  你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Take a look at his eye. - How're you doin'?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.12,1:29:49.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 对了  - 不算太坏  我见过更坏的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's right.  - It ain't bad. I seen worse.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.36,1:29:50.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也不坏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ain't so bad yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.92,1:29:53.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 盖着它  很快没事  - 你帮我盖着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Cover up. Things'll be okay. - Cover up? You cover up.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.59,1:29:55.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去冲凉吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go and take a shower, will ya?
