Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.90,1:30:01.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,韦特摩那场是你做助手的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You covered that Whitmar fight, didn't you?
