Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.04,1:30:06.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是冠军材料!  我们有机会赢的!  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen,we got a winner here!We got a chance!
