Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.44,1:30:11.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你准备吧  我们会赢的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just stand by, boy. We're gonna win.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.75,1:30:21.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇  我跟你谈几句可以吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Rock, It's okay I talk to ya?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.15,1:30:23.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我谈几句?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay you talk to me?
