Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.72,1:30:28.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想了几个用你名字赚钱的方法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I figured some angle to make some money off your name.
