Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.30,1:30:34.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 怎样?  - 广告  我在行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How's that?  - Advertisin'. I know about that stuff.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.90,1:30:38.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你对广告有什么认识?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you know about advertisin'? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.47,1:30:44.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你用我的名字赚钱  随便你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you can make money off my name, make it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.78,1:30:46.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去冲凉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna take a shower.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.38,1:30:50.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 帮我脱拳套好吗?  - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wanna help me off with these?  - Sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.91,1:32:26.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一定会打败他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna kill him!
