Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.63,1:33:43.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(意大利牡马)
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.38,1:35:21.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇  你怎么来这里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky. What brings you here tonight?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.99,1:35:25.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,休根斯先生  那海报搞错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Jergens, the poster's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.52,1:35:26.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么意思?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.93,1:35:30.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会穿白裤  有条红间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I'm wearin' white pants with a red stripe.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.23,1:35:36.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这没关系吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It doesn't really matter, does it?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.64,1:35:39.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会给我们一场精彩演出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure you're gonna give us a great show.
