Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.47,1:37:18.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我做不来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.97,1:37:22.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.18,1:37:24.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能打败他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't beat him.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.31,1:37:27.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿波罗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apollo?
