Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.92,1:37:34.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去了那里  想来想去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been out there walkin' around, thinkin'.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.82,1:37:39.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在骗谁?  我根本不是他那个级数\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, who am I kiddin'? I ain't even in the guy's league.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:44.56,1:37:45.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们打算怎样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.61,1:37:59.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.65,1:38:07.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你已经很努力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You worked so hard.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:09.25,1:38:12.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系  反正我以前都只是无名之辈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It don't matter, 'cause I was nobody before.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.83,1:38:16.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要那样说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't say that.
