Dialogue: 0,1:38:19.50,1:38:21.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是无名之辈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was nobody.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.90,1:38:25.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但那也没关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it don't matter either, you know?
