Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.75,1:38:42.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只想好好的打一场  坚持到最后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause all I wanna do is go the distance.
