Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.73,1:38:57.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当钟声响起  而我还站着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}see, if that bell rings and I'm still standin'...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.91,1:39:06.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那将会是我人生中第一次证明...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna know for the first time in my life, you see...
