Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.83,1:40:34.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你今天好漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're lookin' very great today...you know that?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.97,1:40:40.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要去了  但你不要走太远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta go now, but, uh, don't you leave town, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.47,1:40:43.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祝我好运  我需要运气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wish me luck. I'm gonna need it.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.64,1:40:46.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祝你好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.71,1:40:49.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾莉  你觉不觉得这件袍太大?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say, Adrian, you don't think this robe is too baggy, huh?
