Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.56,1:41:00.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢  比尔·鲍温\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Bill Baldwin.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:00.69,1:41:03.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚非常兴奋  因为洛奇·巴尔博亚...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The electricity is all over the place tonight as Rocky Balboa...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:05.46,1:41:07.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, what the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:07.20,1:41:09.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我训练你做拳手  不是广告板\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I trained you to be a fighter, not a billboard.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.67,1:41:12.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是帮朋友的  - 你有什么好处?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm doin' it for a friend. - What do you get out of it?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:12.57,1:41:14.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保利得到三千元  我得到这件袍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Paulie gets three grand, I get the robe.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:14.71,1:41:15.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真聪明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shrewd.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.58,1:41:18.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚这场赛事  两位拳手的高下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The story about tonight's fight, their difference in style,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.04,1:41:21.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正如一本近期的体育杂志所形容\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you can quote a recent sports magazine which said,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:21.28,1:41:23.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是"野人对骑士"  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Could be the caveman against the cavalier."
Dialogue: 0,1:41:23.52,1:41:25.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后面有起哄声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I noticed a buzzing in the background now, Bill.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:25.98,1:41:28.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能是挑战者准备上擂台\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could be the challengers getting ready to get into the ring.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.39,1:41:31.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇  看我的女伴  花了200元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky! Look at my date. Cost me $200.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:31.79,1:41:34.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是250元  - 我要走了  要工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- 250.  - I gotta go. I gotta work.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:34.36,1:41:36.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这件袍怎么样?  - 大了点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How's the robe?  - It's a little baggy.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.93,1:41:39.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个1赔50的冷门拳手 演绎着灰姑娘的故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A 50 to 1 underdog living a Cinderella story,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:39.83,1:41:43.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他体现了全球观众的梦想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he's captured people's imaginations all over the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:47.97,1:41:49.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇  我们爱你 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We love you, Rocky!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:49.64,1:41:52.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 祝你好运  拳王  - 谢谢你来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good luck, champ. - Hey, thanks for showin' up.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:53.35,1:41:55.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的纪录是44场胜赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And his record... 44 victories.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.25,1:41:58.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,38场击倒  20场败赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's got 38 by knockout, and he's lost 20 fights.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.32,1:42:00.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不禁想  他捱得住吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which makes me wonder, can he stand it...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:00.65,1:42:03.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要有耐力和技术支持三回合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the stamina and the skill to last the three rounds?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:03.12,1:42:05.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根据赔率就绝不看好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because Las Vegas odds say no.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:05.46,1:42:08.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇·巴尔博亚  正在攀上擂台\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky Balboa climbing into the ring now.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:08.93,1:42:10.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"意大利牡马" \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Italian Stallion.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.66,1:42:12.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,袍后面有冻肉标志\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some meat sign on the back of his robe there.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.00,1:42:15.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看见是什么吗?  森乐冻肉公司...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you seen what that was? Shamrock Meats, Inc.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.50,1:42:20.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,背后又开始起哄  简直是震耳欲聋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A lot of noise coming from the back. You could go deaf with that noise.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:20.41,1:42:22.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有大光灯照着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have the spotlights.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.28,1:42:26.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是世界重量级拳王 阿波罗·奎迪吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that the world heavyweight champion Apollo Creed?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:26.51,1:42:29.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他坐在船上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's in a boat... riding in a boat.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:29.08,1:42:30.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在扮乔治·华盛顿吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is he supposed to be George Washington?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.88,1:42:34.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很明显是  他戴了假发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Obviously so. He's got the hat on, the whole thing. Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:34.12,1:42:35.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全副装束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.69,1:42:37.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,世界拳王  阿波罗·奎迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The world champion Apollo Creed
Dialogue: 0,1:42:37.59,1:42:40.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,模仿乔治华盛顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is doing an imitation of George Washington.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:42.16,1:42:43.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他在派钱  - 我不相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's throwing money.  - I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:43.90,1:42:47.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们小时候读书  说乔治·华盛顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember we were talking about George Washington throwing the dollar?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.33,1:42:48.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抛1元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Throwing the dollar.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:48.53,1:42:51.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那时候的1元值钱很多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Course, if you threw a dollar in those days, it went a lot farther.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:51.67,1:42:53.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在他脱去金假发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, he's taking his...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:53.41,1:42:55.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,脱了假发  摘了帽子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}White wig came off, the hat came off.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:57.24,1:42:58.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要你 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:00.01,1:43:02.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,观众非常兴奋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the crowd is loving every minute of it...look at that.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:02.75,1:43:04.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这位就是世界重量级拳王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here is the world heavyweight champion.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:04.65,1:43:06.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿波罗·奎迪  他为全球观众\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apollo Creed... for you around the world
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.65,1:43:09.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,装扮成我国之父乔治·华盛顿的模样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he was dressed as George Washington, the father of our country.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.95,1:43:11.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要你 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:15.56,1:43:17.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不敢相信  是山姆大叔 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh! Look at that! Uncle Sam himself.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:17.96,1:43:19.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要你 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.73,1:43:21.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要你们全部人 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All of you!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.13,1:43:23.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要你们全部人  他这样说到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"All of you." he's saying.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:23.07,1:43:24.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他好像一面大国旗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He looks like a big flag.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:25.00,1:43:27.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要你 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you. You.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:27.57,1:43:30.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他在对我说吗?  - 他在对你说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is he talkin' to me?  - He's talkin' to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.31,1:43:32.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他在对我说吗?  - 让他说去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is he talkin' to me?  - Let him talk while he can talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:33.04,1:43:34.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要那匹牡马 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want the Stallion!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:35.38,1:43:37.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说"我要那匹牡马"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He says, "I want the Stallion. I want the Stallion."
Dialogue: 0,1:43:39.12,1:43:42.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外国观众或者不知道  一次大战时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In foreign countries, during WWI,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:42.35,1:43:45.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美国陆军和海军的征兵海报里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there was the picture of Uncle Sam with his finger pointed like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:45.36,1:43:48.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是山姆大叔那样指着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A recruiting poster for our fellows in the service...the Army and the Navy.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:48.49,1:43:51.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说"我要你"  那正是他在模仿的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"I want you." That's what he's doing a take of.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.56,1:43:53.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在大叫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There he is. That's it, Creed.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:53.60,1:43:55.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奎迪三回合内胜出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Creed in three.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.23,1:43:57.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他那套衣服要多少钱?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think that outfit cost?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:07.68,1:44:09.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位观众\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ladies and gentlemen...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:10.82,1:44:12.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.38,1:44:14.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祝大家新年快乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A very happy New Year.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:14.79,1:44:17.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎来到费城\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to Philadelphia.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:17.12,1:44:19.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚名人汇聚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, everybody who's anybody is here tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:19.69,1:44:21.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时间...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:21.73,1:44:28.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时间不容许我逐一介绍  今晚出席的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time does not permit me to introduce the many luminaries of politics,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.80,1:44:33.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,政界  演艺界和体育界的杰出人士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}show business, and the sporting world who are with us tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:33.24,1:44:38.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我想有请  拳击界的不朽神话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I would like to present one of the immortals of pugilism,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:38.51,1:44:42.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,擂台内外都是冠军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a champion in and out of the ring,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:42.58,1:44:48.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,属于费城的"火辣祖"  备受爱戴的费西亚先生 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Philadelphia's own Smoking Joe, the beloved Mr. Joe Frazier!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:58.53,1:45:00.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How you doin'?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:00.43,1:45:02.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,手下留情  好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't hurt him, okay? Go light on him.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:03.64,1:45:05.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的拳击生涯是那么光辉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he's been in his career as a fighter.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:05.70,1:45:07.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在他正过去跟拳王说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now he's coming over to talk to the Champ.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:07.61,1:45:09.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 嘿  怎么样?  - 嘿  祖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, how 'bout that? - Hey, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.07,1:45:12.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你避了我很久了  - 不  祖  你是下一个对手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You've been ducking me long time. - No, Joe. You're next, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.64,1:45:15.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 明白吗?  - 下一个到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I want you, you understand?  - You're next, Joe!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.51,1:45:17.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们一定是好朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They must be friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:25.46,1:45:27.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祖·费西亚 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Joe Frazier!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:27.46,1:45:31.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赛事很快便会开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fight is on the way. Settle down because it won't be long now.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:33.16,1:45:37.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在...要介绍今晚的比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now... for the main event.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:42.87,1:45:44.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,挑战者  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The challenger,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:44.88,1:45:49.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,穿白裤  重190磅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}white trunks, weighing 190 pounds,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:49.45,1:45:51.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,费城的宠儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Philadelphia's favorite son,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:52.02,1:45:57.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绰号"意大利牡马"  洛奇·巴尔博亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Italian Stallion, Rocky Balboa.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:03.70,1:46:06.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而在我右面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And on my right,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:06.26,1:46:08.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,穿着红白蓝三色\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}wearing red, white and blue,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:08.50,1:46:12.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重210磅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}weighing 210 pounds,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:12.14,1:46:15.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,46场不败纪录\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}undefeated in 46 fights,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:15.64,1:46:18.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绰号"灾难大师"  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the master of disaster,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:18.64,1:46:22.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无可争议的世界重量级拳王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the undisputed, heavyweight champion of the world
Dialogue: 0,1:46:22.41,1:46:24.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿波罗·奎迪 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apollo Creed.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:26.65,1:46:29.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要你  你  你 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you and you. You. You.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:31.56,1:46:34.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你  傻佬  我要你 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You, chump. I want you!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:34.29,1:46:37.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们两人都在费城比过赛 应该知道规矩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You boys both fought in Philadelphia before, and you know the rules.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:37.53,1:46:40.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可攻击腰部以下 记着不可用头撞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No low blows, watch your heads, no butting.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:40.63,1:46:42.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,握手  出去比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shake hands now and come out fightin'.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:42.20,1:46:43.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,举高手  傻佬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put your hands up there, chump.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:44.00,1:46:45.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 快来比赛  - 来吧 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come out fightin'. - Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.27,1:46:50.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来洛奇很小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky's takin' it carefully.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:50.07,1:46:53.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇很冷静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's just going over and being calm, it looks like from here.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:54.85,1:46:56.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要摘下帽子了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There goes the big hat.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:59.45,1:47:02.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从未见过有拳手会在意发型\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never seen a fighter that concerned about his hair.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:11.86,1:47:13.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一回合钟声响了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And there's the bell for round one.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:14.90,1:47:18.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两个拳手步向擂台中央  看着对方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fighters come into the center of the ring, looking at each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:18.14,1:47:19.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇还在观察\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky just looking.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:19.54,1:47:24.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拳王奎迪  迅速发动左拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Champion gives one of the left-handed jabs right there.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:26.58,1:47:30.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拳王随心所欲地 拳击较慢的挑战者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Champ's stinging, the slower challenger jabs at will.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:30.15,1:47:34.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇用面部来挡拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In fact, it just looks like Rocky's blocking the blows with his face.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:34.22,1:47:36.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拳王不是在最佳状态\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Champion doesn't look the best he's ever been,
Dialogue: 0,1:47:36.62,1:47:38.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他正在进入状态\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but he's really moving now.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:38.39,1:47:40.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拳王笑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, the Champion is smiling now.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:40.63,1:47:42.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在玩弄他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's toying with this man.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:42.99,1:47:44.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尽量令入场观众值回票价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trying to give the fans their money's worth.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:47.70,1:47:50.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很明显他远胜挑战者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's very clearly outdoing the challenger right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:51.70,1:47:53.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会打倒你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll get you. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:53.61,1:47:57.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他令对手的拳那样落空\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's just trying to make this man make him...see! Make him miss like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:58.94,1:48:01.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拳王在嘲弄他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, the Champ is just taunting him now.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.65,1:48:06.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奎迪在跳舞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's dancing around.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:07.65,1:48:09.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难以置信 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:09.62,1:48:11.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 拳王倒地了  - 确实如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The Champ is down.  - Yes, he is!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:17.96,1:48:21.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奎迪倒地了  真想不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Creed is down! What a surprise this is!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:22.43,1:48:25.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是拳王首次被击倒地上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the first time the Champion has ever been knocked down.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:27.94,1:48:31.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,六  七  八\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Six... seven... eight.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:31.28,1:48:33.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他看来没有大碍  有点呆滞但没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Appears to be all right. A little glassy-eyed, but okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:35.88,1:48:38.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打他肋骨 努力  洛奇  加油 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go to work right now, Rock! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:40.22,1:48:43.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇再出场  他好像很笨拙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now Rocky coming back out, and he's like a bull in a china closet.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:43.62,1:48:44.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他很努力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He really wants it.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:47.16,1:48:48.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拳王一出场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boy, the Champion's coming back.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:48.89,1:48:52.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就想了结他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's coming off the floor now, and he's trying...
Dialogue: 0,1:48:52.13,1:48:54.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,左拳  右拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A left, a right, another left, another right, combination!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:54.87,1:48:57.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都打到脸上  那才是我们认识的阿波罗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Into the face! And that's the Apollo we know.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:01.67,1:49:03.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拳王正在挑衅洛奇打他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now he's taunting him.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:03.07,1:49:05.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拳王正在挑衅洛奇打他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's taunting Rocky. "Come on, let's go."
Dialogue: 0,1:49:05.24,1:49:06.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,左拳  再一拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Left. There's another left.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:07.48,1:49:08.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再一个左拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Another left.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:10.38,1:49:12.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇反攻了 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:13.62,1:49:15.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇把他逼到围绳上 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Left and right. Rocky's got him on the rope!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:17.26,1:49:18.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,分开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, break.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:24.00,1:49:27.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们没预见到这样的攻击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I tell you, there's no way we expected this kind of hitting from him.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:27.23,1:49:29.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绝对没有  但是凭着拳王的能力...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no way, but with the ability of the Champion...
Dialogue: 0,1:49:34.24,1:49:37.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿波罗狂出左拳  他逼了他到围绳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apollo unloading a left, really trying to get him up against the ropes.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:46.05,1:49:48.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们引导他回台角  洛奇找不到方向\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're leading him over to his corner. Rocky can hardly find his way.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:48.65,1:49:50.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他现在坐下来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's sitting down now.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:50.82,1:49:52.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说过了 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told ya! I told ya!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:52.59,1:49:53.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你鼻梁断了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your nose is broke.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:53.99,1:49:56.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 看上去怎样?  - 更好看了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How's it look?  - Ah, it's an improvement.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:56.43,1:49:59.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要再做无聊动作 要出拳和走位 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to quit chuckin' and jivin'. I want you to stick and move.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:59.86,1:50:03.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,攻他肋骨  要他透不过气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go for the ribs. Don't let that bastard breathe.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:03.43,1:50:04.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他很棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The guy's great.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:04.90,1:50:08.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不知道这是场表演  他以为是拳赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He doesn't know it's a damn show. He thinks it's a damn fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:08.97,1:50:11.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞定那废柴  我们便可回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Finish this bum and let's go home.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:12.08,1:50:14.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,继续攻胸腹位置  你表现得好好 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay to the body. The body! You're doing great!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:18.55,1:50:20.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奎迪在第一回合被击倒 然后强势反攻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Creed got knocked down at the end of the first.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:20.28,1:50:23.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在他努力进攻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He came back strong at the end of the first, but he's working hard.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:23.96,1:50:27.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,清脆的左拳  再加个强劲的右钩拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A smart left. Another left and a right.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:27.19,1:50:29.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来了  他把对手再次逼到角落...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now coming into the corner again...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:36.63,1:50:39.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇·巴尔博亚在捱打...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Balboa's taking a tremendous beating here...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:45.14,1:50:47.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不懂打拳吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, come on, man. Can't you fight?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:47.15,1:50:50.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要再装模作样  给点东西观众 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop clownin' around here and give these people something to see.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:51.88,1:50:53.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说要继续 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He says he wants him!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:54.49,1:50:58.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果大家没有意识到这是一场战斗...那就让我告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you folks aren't aware... you're watching a battle...I tell you that.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:03.16,1:51:04.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇·巴尔博亚尝试反攻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Balboa trying to fight back.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:04.60,1:51:06.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢  他击中了拳王 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh! He tagged the Champ with a tremendous hook!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:06.83,1:51:09.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拳王想脱身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Champion is trying to get himself out of there,
Dialogue: 0,1:51:09.23,1:51:10.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但做不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but he just can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:10.87,1:51:14.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拳王的头部和身躯 被对手的左右拳狂攻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is being barraged with lefts and rights to the head, to the body.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:14.07,1:51:18.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇·巴尔博亚在重击拳王头部 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Balboa is smacking the Champion right on the kisser.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:18.88,1:51:22.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拳证停止了比赛  但他们还想继续\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the referee's... they're ready to keep going. Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:22.51,1:51:24.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 回到你的台角去  - 拳王回到你的台角去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Back to your corner.  - Put that chump back in his corner.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:25.02,1:51:27.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 来  奎迪  - 洛奇还想继续\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on, Creed.  - Balboa doesn't want to quit. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:27.79,1:51:29.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是一场恶战呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is gonna be a tough one.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:24.01,1:52:26.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在他被击中了  一个左拳  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now he's got him. A left.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:36.52,1:52:38.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,左右夹攻 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A hard left and a right combination.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:38.86,1:52:41.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 比尔  是什么驱使他还撑着?  - 我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What is keeping him up, Bill?  - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:44.40,1:52:46.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他连手也无法抬起来挡拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He can't even get his gloves up to protect himself.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:46.66,1:52:48.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得停下来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He needs to stop, Bill.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:54.41,1:52:56.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伏下  不要起来 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Down! Down! Stay down!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:56.81,1:52:59.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿波罗已高举双手 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apollo dancing around with his arms in the air.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:09.89,1:53:13.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,五  六 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}five... six...
Dialogue: 0,1:53:14.23,1:53:17.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,七  八  九\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}seven... eight... nine...
Dialogue: 0,1:53:27.37,1:53:29.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿波罗不能相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apollo can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:46.36,1:53:49.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拳王的右肋骨中了对手的左拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Champion got a left to the ribs... his right rib.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:49.76,1:53:51.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这真是一场精彩的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, this has been a tremendous...
Dialogue: 0,1:53:57.74,1:54:00.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 拳王  行吗?  - 我没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay, Champ?  - Yeah, I'm okay. I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:00.30,1:54:03.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可能断了肋骨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It hurts, though. He broke my rib.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:03.21,1:54:05.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看不见了  得打开眼睛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't see nothin'. You gotta open my eye.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:05.51,1:54:07.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 割开它  - 我不想这样做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Cut me, Mick. - I don't wanna do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:07.41,1:54:10.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 动手吧  割开它  - 好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Go on, cut me. Cut me.  - Ok.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:10.35,1:54:12.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,试割开它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try it.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:16.09,1:54:17.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:17.66,1:54:20.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你内出血  我要叫停比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're bleeding inside, Champ. I'm gonna stop the fight, understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:20.16,1:54:23.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不可以叫停\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ain't stoppin' nothin', man. You ain't stoppin' nothin'.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:23.63,1:54:26.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你叫停比赛的话  我杀了你  - 知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You stop this fight, I'll kill ya. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:26.53,1:54:30.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 随便你  - 我出场了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Go if you wanna go.  - I'm goin'.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:30.33,1:54:33.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得去  使出全身本领  打倒他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta go. You gotta give it all. Give it all!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:33.24,1:54:35.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要尽全力  你要打中他 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta get him. You gotta work on that body.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:39.84,1:54:42.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已到了第十五回合  也是最后回合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The crowd is on fire. The 15th and final round.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:51.59,1:54:53.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们看上去就像在打仗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They look like they've been in a war... these two.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:03.13,1:55:05.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拳王打中了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, the Champion really tagged him!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:05.70,1:55:09.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿波罗明显在保护他的右边肋骨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Apollo clearly protecting his right side... his ribs.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:14.81,1:55:16.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重左拳和右拳 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hard left and right!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:16.48,1:55:19.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 看他口里喷出来的血  - 他在吐血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Look at the blood coming from his face. - Oh, he's spitting up blood now.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:23.55,1:55:26.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇出了一个劲右拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A tremendous right hand by Rocky.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:26.49,1:55:27.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油  洛奇 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go for it! Go for it, Rock!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:28.03,1:55:30.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听听现场观众的欢呼声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to this crowd!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:30.86,1:55:34.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再一拳击中肋骨  加一下左拳 一拳中下巴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh! Another to the rib. That left hand again right to the chin!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:34.73,1:55:36.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他把他逼到围绳 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh! He's got him up against the ropes!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:36.60,1:55:37.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿波罗拳王...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apollo the Champ.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:42.11,1:55:44.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会有复赛  不会有复赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ain't gonna be no rematch. Ain't gonna be no rematch.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:45.64,1:55:46.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不想复赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't want one.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:57.49,1:56:00.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇  你坚持到底  打了十五个回合 你觉得怎样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky, you went the 15 rounds. How do you feel?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:00.19,1:56:01.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:01.33,1:56:03.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你打完第十五回合时 脑里在想什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What were you thinking about when that buzzer sounded?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:03.39,1:56:04.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾莉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Adrian!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:04.96,1:56:07.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?  艾莉!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? Adrian!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:07.53,1:56:09.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:09.17,1:56:10.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:10.43,1:56:12.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女士们  先生们  今晚...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ladies and gentlemen, your attention, please...Tonight,
Dialogue: 0,1:56:13.00,1:56:14.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky?
